<!-- Example of Digital NOTAM for new permanent obstacle (antenna) with only mandatory properties:

                        Group: -
                       Mobile: -
                Obstacle Type: ANTENNA
                   Start Time: 2028-01-10 06:30
                     End Time: PERM
                     Schedule: -
                  Description: -
             Location Remarks: -
      Obstacle Identification: -
                     Geometry: Point
        Geographical Accuracy: -
                    Elevation: 75 M
                       Height: -
                     Lighting: YES
          Marking Description: -
        Affected Aerodrome(s): -
              Affected FIR(s): EAAD
                         Note: -
  
     The antenna is erected on 2028-01-10T06:30:00Z. It will be subsequently published in the AIP on the next suitable AIRAC date (i.e. 2028-02-17T00:00:00Z).
     After 15 days since the obstacle is published (on 2028-03-03T00:00:00Z), the NOTAM (Event) will be canceled. -->

